# Binds an inert device process to one already-created dataset session.
# Repeating the same request_id with the same payload is idempotent. Reusing it
# with different fields must be rejected. Implementations must refuse prepare
# while streaming and must never create or overwrite the session directory.
string request_id
string session_id
string session_directory
---
bool accepted
bool duplicate_request
string message
